>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. APPOINTMENT-AUDIT.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT AUDIT-FILE ASSIGN TO DYNAMIC LS-PATH
      ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS LS-FS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD AUDIT-FILE.
01 AUDIT-LINE             PIC X(512).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "appointment-status.cpy".
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 LS-PATH                PIC X(256).
01 LS-FS                  PIC XX.
01 LS-NOW                 PIC X(21).
01 LS-CURRENT-DATE        PIC X(21).
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-ACTION              PIC X(24).
01 LK-ID                  PIC X(9).
01 LK-SOURCE              PIC X(8).
01 LK-DETAIL              PIC X(160).
COPY "appointment-config.cpy".
01 LK-STATUS              PIC 9(3).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-ACTION LK-ID LK-SOURCE LK-DETAIL
    APPOINTMENT-CONFIG LK-STATUS.
    MOVE AC-AUDIT-FILE TO LS-PATH
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO LS-CURRENT-DATE
    STRING LS-CURRENT-DATE(1:4) "-" LS-CURRENT-DATE(5:2) "-"
      LS-CURRENT-DATE(7:2) "T" LS-CURRENT-DATE(9:2) ":"
      LS-CURRENT-DATE(11:2) ":" LS-CURRENT-DATE(13:2) "Z"
      INTO LS-NOW
    END-STRING
    INITIALIZE AUDIT-LINE
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(LS-NOW) " | " FUNCTION TRIM(LK-ACTION)
      " | ID=" LK-ID " | SOURCE=" FUNCTION TRIM(LK-SOURCE)
      " | " FUNCTION TRIM(LK-DETAIL) INTO AUDIT-LINE
    END-STRING
    OPEN EXTEND AUDIT-FILE
    IF LS-FS = "35" OPEN OUTPUT AUDIT-FILE END-IF
    IF LS-FS = "00"
      WRITE AUDIT-LINE
      CLOSE AUDIT-FILE
      MOVE APPT-OK TO LK-STATUS
    ELSE
      MOVE APPT-IO-ERROR TO LK-STATUS
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM APPOINTMENT-AUDIT.
